# Font sources are downloaded once per site and never served directly.
# Committing them is fine and intended -- the subset output in public/fonts is
# what ships. Nothing to ignore here; this note exists so nobody adds a rule.

# Staged R2 payload: files too large for git, uploaded by `npm run r2:sync`.
# See r2/README.md. Never in git.
r2-assets/
data/verify/.cache/

# Grade price source responses. `npm run prices` caches every page it reads here
# and commits the FIGURES, with their URLs and the date, to data/grade-prices.json
# instead. Two guides times three hundred issues of full HTML is a few hundred
# megabytes and a diff nobody can read; the owner's decision of 2026-09-21.
data/prices/.cache/
